WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.037
Section 7.

00:00:01.987 --> 00:00:06.050
International comparison — dead last among allies.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.550
The United States has the False Claims Act with qui tam provisions.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:14.300
The UK has the Public Interest Disclosure Act.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.062
Australia has a National Anti-Corruption Commission.

00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:20.487
Canada has none of these.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:25.725
Among Five Eyes nations, Canada ranks last in whistleblower protection.
